  "meta": {
    "notes": "Kairen's summit (the private project notes): a karst peak top, the land falling away on every bearing into the cloud sea, the crown's spires on the rim at the back left. Saved from CLOUD_CROWN, which stays in sceneryKits.ts (and groundPatches.ts) as the runtime fallback. Dressed from Jadeveil's own prop kit since 2026-10-22 (the private project notes): the crown's crags on the rim, karst towers in the cloud sea; nothing of the Empire's alpine set. Since the Jadeveil arenas feature (2026-10-22): an edge fill out to the camera's reach — karst towers and crags standing out of the cloud sea, banks of cloud lying on it (`EdgeFill.below`), boulders and pines on the peak top — and flags at the head of the summit."
  },
